This solution reuses publicly released HDJoJo models and the inference design from
https://www.kaggle.com/code/hdjojo/solar-filament-segmentation version 2.
Model handles and exact SHA256 files are in weights/manifest.json.
Upstream notebook and model cards declared Apache License 2.0 on 2026-11-14.
Changes by shepsci: retain a model's valid predictions when the other is empty;
portable paths/device selection, self-contained Git LFS weight packaging,
exact hashes, native RLE/disjointness validation and execution receipts.
Ultralytics and all other dependencies retain their own licenses; see their distributions.
No competition images, annotations or third-party prediction files are included.

Siva Kumar discussed pixel-disjoint masks and confidence-ordered painting in
https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/filament-segmentation-2026/discussion/735377
(2026-08-15). The validation helper preserves this attribution.
